@startuml
' Source block: uml251_11_interaction_overview_approximation (uml-2.5.1-legend.puml intake)
!include ../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/interaction/interaction-overview-diagram-style.iuml
' ============================================================================
' Section 11 — Interaction Overview concepts
'
' UML traceability:
'   UML 2.5.1 §17.10 Interaction Overview Diagrams
'
' PlantUML support: Approximation.
' The UML notation combines Activity-style control flow with
' InteractionUses / Interactions. PlantUML has no dedicated
' Interaction Overview diagram syntax, so Activity syntax is used.
' ============================================================================

title UML 2.5.1 Notation Reference — Interaction Overview (Approximation)
' Framework monochrome mode (replaces `skinparam monochrome true`).
UML_MONOCHROME()

start
:[ref Authenticate]\nInteractionUse approximation;

if (authorized?) then (yes)
  fork
    :[ref Reserve Inventory]\nInteractionUse approximation;
  fork again
    :[ref Authorize Payment]\nInteractionUse approximation;
  end fork

  :[ref Fulfill Order]\nInteractionUse approximation;
else (no)
  :[ref Reject Request]\nInteractionUse approximation;
endif

stop

legend
  |= UML Interaction Overview concept |= Mapping |
  | Initial / final node | activity start/stop |
  | Decision / merge | activity if/endif |
  | Fork / join | activity fork/end fork |
  | InteractionUse / occurrence | labeled action box — approximation |
  | Referenced Interaction | textual [ref ...] label — approximation |
endlegend
@enduml
